    "title": "Franklin pub license suspended temporarily after deadly crash - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Abril Preciado ,\n2 hours ago FRANKLIN, Wis. - A Franklin pub will temporarily lose its licenses this fall in connection with a deadly crash that killed a man and his dog 19 months ago. The Franklin Common Council voted Tuesday night, June 2, to suspend the Class B combination license and entertainment and amusement license for The Irish Cottage. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
